  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Ku Mu mountain, outside the old earth wood where immortal zombie Gu Ye keeps Old Earth City, he shouts for Gu Ye to come out and discuss a matter. In the sky beside Divine Lord Tian Du he has messy hair and looks like a brute carrying a skull. When Gu Ye calls the offered price robbery, he snickers that robbery is possible too, and that he only meant to do Divine Lord Tian Du a favor. Gu Ye sells one hundred and fifty kilograms of wilted essence for one immortal essence stone, and the two leave laughing.",
      "chapters": [
        738
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_ku_mu_mountain",
        "char_gu_ye",
        "loc_old_earth_city",
        "char_divine_lord_tian_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan watches the pair vanish over the horizon. Gu Ye later holds up that same stone as the price they paid, saying they still gave Zombie Alliance a thin show of face.",
      "chapters": [
        739
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has messy hair and looks like a brute carrying a skull.",
      "chapters": [
        738
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a muscular man, rugged and brutish, with hair in a mess, and he holds a skull in his hands.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that Divine Lord Tian Du, cultivating lightning path, had once coerced a Zombie Alliance immortal zombie with Shi Hou in that wilted essence deal. When Unfettered Scholar blocks Divine Lord Tian Du, Tian Du calls Shi Hou for help. Shi Hou appears with messy hair and a skull in hand, activates a mortal killer move, and the two press Unfettered Scholar together before an explosion sends both flying back while Unfettered Scholar stays calm.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fight-beside-divine-lord-tian-du",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_unfettered_scholar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside Divine Lord Tian Du, Lu Qing Ming, and He Ruo, he helps seal escape routes around Dong Fang Chang Fan while other demonic path Gu Immortals attack.",
      "chapters": [
        802
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "northern-plains-field-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_qing_ming",
        "char_he_ruo",
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later ranking of Northern Plains activity places him with Zhuo Zhan, Divine Lord Tian Du, and other experts among rank six Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        1101
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-six-ranking",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "char_zhuo_zhan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later scramble over Hei tribe nests he cheers over gaining the rank seven immortal material domination copper.",
      "chapters": [
        1108
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
